<DedupeExplorer />

## Consequences

Triage must read more context than a subject line. Engineering gains separate fix scopes and
reproducible counts. Recompute against a fresh export as the desk continues working. This page
does not edit the accepted historical decision or claim authority to approve a support-desk policy.

